# The build context is an allowlist: only what the image build needs.
# Everything else, including .env and .git, never reaches the build. tests/
# reaches only the `dev` stage, which compose.e2e.yaml builds.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!alembic.ini
!migrations/
!tests/
**/__pycache__
